{"text":"I was never deterred from running for president just because there had never been any other female elected as a head of state in Africa, simply because political leadership in Liberia has always been a boys' club and didn't mean it was right, and so I remain undeterred. Today an unprecedented number of women hold leader positions in our country and throughout Africa, and the numbers increase annually. As you approach your future, there will be ample opportunity to become jaded and cynical by an urge you to resist cynicism. The world is still a beautiful place, and change is possible. As I have noted yet today, my pathway to presidency was never straightforward or guaranteed. With prison, death traps and exile, there were many opportunities to quit, to forget about the dream, yet we all persisted.","words":[{"text":"I","start":0.0,"end":0.44},{"text":"was","start":0.44,"end":0.86},{"text":"never","start":0.86,"end":1.12},{"text":"deterred","start":1.12,"end":1.78},{"text":"from","start":1.78,"end":1.96},{"text":"running","start":1.96,"end":2.2},{"text":"for","start":2.2,"end":2.46},{"text":"president","start":2.46,"end":2.76},{"text":"just","start":2.76,"end":3.06},{"text":"because","start":3.06,"end":3.44},{"text":"there","start":3.44,"end":3.6},{"text":"had","start":3.6,"end":3.74},{"text":"never","start":3.74,"end":4.0},{"text":"been","start":4.0,"end":4.2},{"text":"any","start":4.2,"end":4.48},{"text":"other","start":4.48,"end":4.76},{"text":"female","start":4.76,"end":5.14},{"text":"elected","start":5.14,"end":5.66},{"text":"as","start":5.66,"end":6.42},{"text":"a","start":6.42,"end":6.54},{"text":"head","start":6.54,"end":6.68},{"text":"of","start":6.68,"end":6.82},{"text":"state","start":6.82,"end":7.0},{"text":"in","start":7.0,"end":7.16},{"text":"Africa","start":7.16,"end":7.62,"punct":","},{"text":"simply","start":8.72,"end":9.0},{"text":"because","start":9.0,"end":9.44},{"text":"political","start":9.44,"end":9.9},{"text":"leadership","start":9.9,"